  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of the execution of works and services aimed at increasing the capacity of water supply and the efficiency of the water production system to the population of two major regions in the city of Belem, Para (the &#x201C;Project&#x201D;). The Project was awarded through a public tender and awarded to the Company by the State of Para Sanitation Company (Cosanpa or the &#x201C;Grantor&#x201D;). The total Project costs are estimated to be R$ 303,956,000.</narrative>
  </description>
